        <p class="surface-kicker">Fuentes principales</p>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="https://www.fda.gov/regulatory-information/search-fda-guidance-documents/guidance-content-premarket-notification-510k-submissions-piston-syringes" rel="noreferrer">U.S. FDA. <em>Guidance on the Content of Premarket Notification [510(k)] Submissions for Piston Syringes</em>.</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.iso.org/standard/60510.html" rel="noreferrer">ISO 8537:2016. <em>Sterile single-use syringes, with or without needle, for insulin</em>.</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.bd.com/documents/international/catalogs/medication-delivery-solutions/MDS_Medication-Delivery-Solutions-Product-Catalogue_CT_EN.pdf" rel="noreferrer">BD. <em>Medication Delivery Solutions Product Catalogue</em> — ejemplos de jeringas 1 mL, U-40, U-100 y graduaciones de 0,01 mL.</a></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="source-note">Research Basics explica lectura de dispositivos y escalas. No determina dosis, vía, frecuencia ni protocolo de administración.</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

